\end{equation*}
The basal shear traction is

\begin{equation*}
\sigma_{xz}=\mu\bigl[\psi''+k^{2}\psi\bigr]\sin kx ,
\end{equation*}
so that with $\tau_{b}=S_{0}\sin kx$

\begin{equation*}
